 ## Key Architecture
 
-- Upstream baseline: PocketBase `v0.38.2`
+- Upstream baseline: PocketBase `v0.39.4`
 - MySQL connection via env vars: `PB_DATABASE_DRIVER=mysql` and `PB_DATABASE_DSN=<dsn>`
